  "worldKey": "{\"ecology\":[{\"biome\":\"desert\",\"density\":0.2,\"id\":\"desert-scrub\",\"kind\":\"shrub\",\"maxSlope\":28,\"scale\":[0.5,1.2],\"spacing\":16},{\"biome\":\"forest\",\"density\":0.95,\"id\":\"forest-canopy\",\"kind\":\"broadleaf\",\"maxSlope\":32,\"scale\":[0.8,1.6],\"spacing\":18},{\"biome\":\"forest\",\"density\":0.6,\"id\":\"forest-pine\",\"kind\":\"pine\",\"maxSlope\":38,\"scale\":[0.9,1.5],\"spacing\":22},{\"biome\":\"grassland\",\"density\":0.4,\"id\":\"meadow-shrub\",\"kind\":\"shrub\",\"maxSlope\":38,\"scale\":[0.7,1.8],\"spacing\":12},{\"biome\":\"grassland\",\"density\":0.1,\"id\":\"meadow-trees\",\"kind\":\"broadleaf\",\"maxSlope\":25,\"scale\":[0.65,1.2],\"spacing\":26},{\"biome\":\"mountains\",\"density\":0.5,\"id\":\"mountain-rock\",\"kind\":\"rock\",\"maxSlope\":55,\"scale\":[1,3],\"spacing\":25}],\"id\":\"forest-oasis-world\",\"prompt\":\"西方是海洋，东方是沙漠，北方是草原，南方是森林，中央是草原。南部林地建一个林业工坊小镇，东部沙漠建一个商队集市镇，以商路相连；森林较密，草原有稀疏树丛，沙漠仅零星灌木。\",\"recipe\":{\"constraints\":[{\"biome\":\"grassland\",\"region\":\"center\"},{\"biome\":\"desert\",\"region\":\"east\"},{\"biome\":\"grassland\",\"region\":\"north\"},{\"biome\":\"forest\",\"region\":\"south\"},{\"biome\":\"ocean\",\"region\":\"west\"}],\"seed\":42,\"size\":64000,\"version\":1},\"revision\":1,\"roads\":[{\"closed\":false,\"curve\":\"polyline\",\"id\":\"trade-route\",\"name\":\"林地—沙漠商路\",\"points\":[[-1010,13250],[-400,13250],[8500,10000],[18000,5750],[18760,5750]],\"tags\":[\"world-road\"],\"width\":14}],\"towns\":[{\"blend\":500,\"center\":[-1250,13250],\"foundation\":239.51407535801877,\"id\":\"forest\",\"name\":\"林间工坊镇\",\"ports\":[{\"guideId\":\"trade-route\",\"id\":\"forest-east\",\"position\":[240,0],\"width\":14}],\"prompt\":\"林业与木工聚落，错落的支路和共享绿地，仓场、工坊和住居分区，向东连接商路。\",\"radius\":240},{\"blend\":500,\"center\":[19000,5750],\"foundation\":360.2855668241125,\"id\":\"oasis\",\"name\":\"沙漠商队镇\",\"ports\":[{\"guideId\":\"trade-route\",\"id\":\"oasis-west\",\"position\":[-240,0],\"width\":14}],\"prompt\":\"围绕开放集市和公共井屋布局，商队院落、货仓、客舍与工坊各有位置，向西连接商路。\",\"radius\":240}],\"version\":1}",
  "summary": "东侧商道进入林业作坊村，入口附近安排验材、仓储和锯木工坊，货运支巷向东南终止在晾材与工具库。主巷在公共绿地南侧转折，议事厅、客栈与面包房围在绿地边缘；北侧工匠巷逐渐分叉成几组独立住宅，南侧窄巷连接织匠、医馆和村民家宅。道路采用错位折线与尽端支巷，保留不规则空地，不重复绿洲镇的矩形集市环街。这里只定义建筑用途和街道，林木及其他绿化由程序规则生成。",
